{
  "about": [
    "The shared library of tiling surfaces. At most twelve. Every one is CC0, from Poly Haven or ambientCG.",
    "size is the side of the colour map in pixels; normal and occlusion/roughness/metal maps are stored at half that.",
    "adjust: saturation and gain applied to the colour map, so one beige stone can stand in for white marble.",
    "roughness: [low, high] the roughness map is squeezed into, so nothing outdoors shines like a wet floor."
